{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4xYBNJGVEkwvJegC1d","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, weathered door. A single keyhole glints dully in my iron plate, waiting.*\n\n*The mechanism inside me shifts, ancient tumblers sensing the approach of intent.*\n\n**click**\n\n*A faint vibration runs through my grain. The ward inside me turns — or tries to. Something catches. Something holds.*\n\n*I remain shut.*\n\n*The keyhole watches you like an eye. A cold draft breathes through it from whatever waits on the other side.*\n\n*Do you have the right one?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":124,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}